{"candidate_id":"figure-analysis:Figure4:e8b01b072a27895a","artifact_id":"Figure4","visual_type":"flowchart","description":"Figure 4 is a three-panel execution-strategy flowchart for an overlapped microbatch pair. Each panel shows a compute stream containing LN, Attn, MLP(B), MLP(W), MLP, Attn(B), Attn(W), and LN operations, with communication streams containing A2A and AR operations connected by dependency lines. The panels compare separate-stream communication, same-stream scheduling, and finer-grained partitioning of DP communication.","components":[{"name":"Panel (a)","role":"Execution strategy using separate DP communication stream","visual_evidence":"The top panel is labeled (a), with a compute stream, Comm stream 1 containing A2A operations, and Comm stream 2 containing a large AR operation; the word interference appears between the communication streams."},{"name":"Panel (b)","role":"Execution strategy scheduling DP communication on the EP communication stream","visual_evidence":"The middle panel is labeled (b), with AR and A2A operations arranged together on Comm stream 1 and a separate AR operation at the far right."},{"name":"Panel (c)","role":"Execution strategy partitioning DP communication into finer-grained operations","visual_evidence":"The bottom panel is labeled (c), with Comm stream 1 containing interleaved AR and A2A operations, including AR, AR₂, and AR₃, plus a final AR operation at the right."},{"name":"Compute stream","role":"Execution timeline for computation","visual_evidence":"All three panels have a row labeled Compute stream containing colored LN, Attn, MLP(B), MLP(W), MLP, Attn(B), Attn(W), and LN blocks."},{"name":"Comm stream 1","role":"Execution timeline for communication operations","visual_evidence":"The panels include rows labeled Comm stream 1 containing A2A and/or AR blocks connected to compute operations."},{"name":"Comm stream 2","role":"Separate communication timeline in panel (a)","visual_evidence":"Panel (a) visibly includes a row labeled Comm stream 2 with a dark-blue AR block."},{"name":"A2A operations","role":"EP all-to-all communication operations","visual_evidence":"Light-colored blocks labeled A2A appear on the communication streams and are linked by lines to compute blocks."},{"name":"AR operations","role":"DP attention allreduce communication operations","visual_evidence":"Dark-blue blocks labeled AR, including AR₂ and AR₃ in panel (c), appear on the communication streams."},{"name":"interference","role":"Resource contention between communication operations","visual_evidence":"The word interference is printed between Comm stream 1 and Comm stream 2 in panel (a)."}],"relationships":[{"source_component":"Compute stream","relation":"contains","target_component":"A2A operations"},{"source_component":"Compute stream","relation":"contains","target_component":"AR operations"},{"source_component":"Comm stream 1","relation":"contains","target_component":"A2A operations"},{"source_component":"Comm stream 1","relation":"contains","target_component":"AR operations"},{"source_component":"Comm stream 2","relation":"contains","target_component":"AR operations"},{"source_component":"AR operations","relation":"causes interference with","target_component":"A2A operations"},{"source_component":"Panel (a)","relation":"uses","target_component":"Comm stream 2"},{"source_component":"Panel (b)","relation":"schedules on","target_component":"Comm stream 1"},{"source_component":"Panel (c)","relation":"partitions","target_component":"AR operations"}],"findings":["Panel (a) separates DP communication onto Comm stream 2 and explicitly marks interference with communication on Comm stream 1.","Panel (b) places AR communication on Comm stream 1, alongside A2A operations.","Panel (c) shows multiple finer-grained AR operations interleaved with A2A operations on Comm stream 1.","The figure compares low-level execution strategies for an overlapped microbatch pair and includes allreduce operations associated with DP for attention."],"citations":[{"section_id":"sec-1~4","path_id":"1~4","quote":"Figure 4. Different low-level execution strategies corresponding to an overlapped microbatch pair in DualPipe (Figures 1 and 2), now including the allreduce from using DP for Attn (dark blue AR boxes)."},{"section_id":"sec-1~4","path_id":"1~4","quote":"(a) Using a separate stream for DP communication can add interference to all-to-alls."},{"section_id":"sec-1~4","path_id":"1~4","quote":"(b) Scheduling DP communication on the stream delays EP allto-alls."},{"section_id":"sec-1~4","path_id":"1~4","quote":"(c) Partitioning DP communication into finer-grained operations and scheduling on the same stream as EP all-toalls can produce the best run time."},{"section_id":"sec-1~11","path_id":"1~11","quote":"DP and EP also use separate streams, so they also will not synchronize with each other."}],"confidence":0.98,"provenance":{"image_sha256":"a77c0813a28f7ef41668de352f255a06963ed46f8459f8261ee48810de1e19ee","context_sha256":"fe87de69f8993cd2e6c2dd7c52950807f7aea21f7a1f5ed3c8a3823789e46645","route_id":"figure-qa-luna","protocol":"openai_chat_completions","requested_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","resolved_model":"cx/gpt-5.6-luna","prompt_sha256":"4786e6f3681b05b0e475e188f0fbd61e98def58906b98ae8010b07dfd44df596","output_schema_sha256":"ce01a5a23e7881cf450e76df819196e554730dbbea77c8ec1cf7e93a2dc11753","schema_id":"diagram_analysis","stage1_visual_type":"flowchart","prompt_task_sha256":"1dd7985b1567eda8d66c3da3478eab188eb6764f7e1445eb1b1014b72ad08dd6","route_policy_sha256":"897498afc82f7598dc9ebd6687dba16a821e18722262df3e299e45136eed1940","model_binding_sha256":"01208a249b295331443fdc61a0e35c1fe80cfdaea164f7a8d95c94b82517f43c","input_sha256":"9f193aa3aa63ed0eaee8cc872700f4e6247a90640146b63c617c7e76d676707b","output_sha256":"fbed7a20f49f1dcf771f9ca411e0a31585db24c8d623c875731a0e2831fdccf0","input_tokens":3914,"output_tokens":1071,"latency_ms":20829},"typed_payload":null,"authoritative":false,"import_eligible":false}